    "product_short_description": "<div class=\"advaya-product-details\">   <p class=\"lead-summary\">\n    <strong>Gentle overnight peel that resurfaces, brightens and softens skin.</strong>\n  </p>      <h3>Product Benefits</h3>   <div class=\"benefits-content\">\n      <p>\u2728 1. Natural Exfoliation:<br/>The blend of Glycolic, Malic, and\n      Lactic acids gently removes dead skin cells, unclogs pores, and\n      boosts cell renewal without damaging the skin barrier.</p>\n    <p>? 2. Brightens and Evens Skin Tone:<br/>Licorice, Vitamin C, and\n      Turmeric reduce dark spots, tanning, and hyperpigmentation, giving\n      your skin a radiant glow.</p>\n    <p>? 3. Smooth Texture &amp; Instant Radiance:<br/>Regular use\n      refines texture, reduces bumps and roughness, and gives baby-soft skin.</p>\n    <p>? 4. Restores Glow Naturally:<br/>A potent mix of Rosehip,\n      Jojoba, and Squalane oils keeps skin nourished, balanced, and luminous.</p>\n    <p>?\u200d\u2640\ufe0f 5. Calms and Soothes:<br/>Chamomile and Aloe Vera minimize\n      irritation, redness, and post-peel dryness.</p>   </div>\n    <h3>How to Use &amp; Rituals</h3>   <div class=\"usage-content\">\n      <p>When to Use:<br/>?\ufe0f Night Only, 1-2 times a week.</p>\n    <p>How to Use:<br/>Cleanse your skin and pat dry.<br/>Apply 4\u20135\n      drops evenly on face and neck using fingertips.<br/>Leave for 6\u20138\n      hours overnight (do not rinse immediately).<br/>Next morning, wash\n      with mild cleanser and apply sunscreen.</p>\n    <p>Patch Test:<br/>Always patch test before first use on inner arm\n      or behind ear for 24 hours.</p>\n    <p>Do Not Use:<br/>On broken or sensitive skin<br/>Directly after\n      waxing or shaving<br/>Alongside other exfoliants or retinoids</p>\n    <p>Storage:<br/>Store in a cool, dark place away from direct sunlight.</p>\n    <p>? WHY USERS WILL LOVE IT<br/>This is a gentle, organic\n      alternative to chemical peels \u2014 designed for visible results\n      without irritation.<br/>Its golden hue, lightweight texture, and\n      natural scent make skincare feel like self-care.</p>\n    <p>Best For:<br/>Dull or tanned skin<br/>Pigmentation, acne marks,\n      or rough texture<br/>Normal to oily skin types (dry skin can\n      follow with moisturizer)</p>   </div>    <h3>Ingredients</h3>   <p class=\"ingredients-list\">\n    <em>Jojoba Oil, Olive-derived Squalane, Rosehip Seed Oil, Turmeric\n      Extract, Glycolic Acid (from Sugarcane), Malic Acid (from Apple\n      Extract), Lactic Acid, Licorice Root Extract, Aloe Vera Extract,\n      Vitamin C (Ascorbyl Tetraisopalmitate), Lemon Peel Oil, Chamomile\n      Essential Oil, Tocopherol (Vitamin E), Natural Preservative.</em>\n  </p>      <div class=\"product-guarantee\">     <p>? <strong>100% Vegan\n        &amp; Cruelty Free</strong> | ?\u200d\u2640\ufe0f <strong>Formulated for Indian\n      Skin</strong> | ? <strong>Safe &amp; Non-Toxic</strong>\n    </p>   </div> </div>",
